What's new in VTHAI v2.3 :
========================

- NEW, improved thai characters display and mode !
- NEW /U parameter to unload or reset back to normal !
- Support many MORE popular programs for thai mode display
- Support many MORE printers !
- Support of DOWNLOADABLE fonts !
- More programmable
- Solved some possible conflict problems
- and more!

VTHAI23.ZIP contains :
--------------------
VTHAI.COM   - Main thai driver program
VHAI23      - Backup file you can copy to VTHAI.COM
VTHAI23.NEW - Latest Information

Sorry for no complete documents, but prepare in next major upgrade.
